{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2022-05-17 10:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT PARTNERS WITH UBS TO OFFER MODEL PORTFOLIOS', 'text': 'SUITE OF DIVERSIFIED OPTIONS PROVIDES ADVISORS WITH TAILORED SOLUTIONS FOR A WIDE RANGE OF INVESTOR INCOME OBJECTIVES NEW YORK , MAY 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BNY MELLON INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT, ONE OF THE WORLD\'S LARGEST ASSET MANAGERS WITH $2.3 TRILLION IN ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT1, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A SUITE OF DIFFERENTIATED MODEL PORTFOLIOS DESIGNED SPECIFICALLY FOR CLIENTS OF UBS WEALTH MANAGEMENT USA ("UBS"). UBS\' US WEALTH MANAGEMENT CLIENTS WILL HAVE ACCESS TO BNY MELLON INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT\'S INNOVATIVE INCOME SOLUTIONS\' SUITE OF SIX MODEL PORTFOLIOS ON UBS\' ACCESS PLATFORM.'}